&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI design or code-generation tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Zendesk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in supporting both self-serve and enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
