&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2381&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b2eb7fa6d9c3&quot;&gt;4+ years of experience in product operations, program management, or a related relevant experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2483&quot; data-local-id=&quot;36fb81e7d9ab&quot;&gt;Experience collaborating across multiple departments (Product, Engineering, Marketing, Sales, etc.) and aligning stakeholders with different priorities toward shared outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2662&quot; data-local-id=&quot;778f95b4c796&quot;&gt;Experience communicating with and presenting to senior leadership at the Director+ level, both in writing and live settings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2790&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e1e2430ab8fd&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with product management and engineering tools (Jira, Confluence, GitHub, or similar), with a willingness to build and improve tooling as needs evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
