&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2964&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a077eefd36e3&quot;&gt;Experience working in ambiguous environments where you&#39;ve had to define the approach, prove out value quickly, and iterate, not just maintain an existing playbook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
