&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3131&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d0fc2c68b013&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead through influence rather than authority, building trust and driving outcomes across teams you don&#39;t directly manage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
