&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3697&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f1c2d2810928&quot;&gt;Professional use of AI tools such as Claude, ChatGPT, or Cursor, including prompt engineering and integrating AI into day-to-day workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
