&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Talent Acquisition Business Partner to join our London-based EMEA team in a fixed-term capacity. Acting as a strategic talent advisor, you will help drive the expansion of our GTM and G&amp;amp;A teams across the EMEA region with full autonomy. You will leverage your deep market expertise, extensive network, and AI-driven strategies to identify and secure top-tier talent for Cloudflare across various functions and regional markets as business needs evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Recruitment &amp;amp; Talent Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and execute comprehensive talent strategies to help hiring leaders build high-performing teams, functioning similarly to how a salesperson puts together a go-to-market plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive Pipeline &amp;amp; Passive Candidate Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt; Draw upon an extensive network of industry contacts to build proactive pipeline strategies across GTM and G&amp;amp;A roles across the EMEA region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Advising:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain solid relationships with the GEO VP and cross-functional stakeholders, including Finance, HRBPs, and compensation teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Agent Integration &amp;amp; Process Optimisation:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with internal automated AI agents and generative tools to eliminate legacy manual tasks, optimise administrative outreach workflows at scale, and synthesise complex market data to inform regional talent strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Utilization &amp;amp; Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage foundational data layers and recruitment analytics to inform talent strategies, actively analysing metrics such as time-to-hire and source efficiency to drive optimal operational decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employer Branding &amp;amp; Market Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and execute strategic employer branding initiatives tailored to the EMEA market to elevate Cloudflare&#39;s profile as a top destination for GTM talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Examples of desirable skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extensive GTM Recruiting Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record of success as a Senior Recruiter, well-versed in scaling sales GTM organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Volume EMEA Recruiting Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience executing high-volume recruitment across diverse EMEA regions while maintaining high quality and low time-to-hire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to operate two &quot;plays&quot; ahead, anticipating potential bottlenecks before they materialise&amp;nbsp; and resolving complex organisational issues with high autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Negotiation &amp;amp; Closing Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Effective negotiation capabilities to secure top-tier candidates, driven by a deep understanding of Cloudflare’s unique value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Ecosystem Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated capability to leverage automated workflows, AI-powered sourcing environments, and LLMs for complex boolean logic, market mapping, and productivity multiplication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Experience Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong organizational skills to eliminate operational friction, ensuring clear communication and proactive engagement throughout the interview lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Influencing:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional written and verbal English skills, with the ability to communicate transparently, foster alignment across teams and stakeholders and leverage data and market insights to influence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability &amp;amp; Self-Direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfort thriving in ever-changing environments, taking complete responsibility for outcomes while seamlessly navigating an evolving technological and organisational landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
