&lt;li&gt;Engage directly with customers and design partners to validate problems, test product concepts, and improve the product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineering and design to deliver new capabilities from early concepts through launch and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with GTM teams on positioning, sales enablement, customer education, and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track developments across the broader AI ecosystem to guide priorities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
