&lt;li&gt;Excited by working in an ever-evolving and fluid solution focused environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in negotiating contract terms and overcoming pricing objections without direct guidance for up-sell and cross sell activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
