&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the sales and customer success teams to articulate the overall Datadog value proposition, vision and strategy to customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continually learn new technology to build competitive knowledge, technical skill, and credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver product and technical presentations with broad range of potential and existing clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a direct line of communication with the product team to collaborate on feature requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help clients try and onboard the product and assist when they run into roadblocks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think creatively and help resolve the wide variety of technical challenges that may&amp;nbsp; occur during the overall customer’s&amp;nbsp; life cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 2+ years in Sales Engineering, Solutions Engineering along with either DevOps/SRE, or Platform Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable and experienced with DevOps monitoring, cloud architecture tools, and modern web development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a high velocity environment demonstrating experience with juggling a high number of concurrent engagements of varied size and complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoys collaborating and teaming with others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable and confident in delivering technical presentations/demos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native-level Japanese proficiency (written and spoken) is required, as you will be communicating directly with customers in Japan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to think creatively about a wide variety of challenges. You&#39;re going to find new things every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoys a hybrid office culture and spending time in-person at our Seoul office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to travel up to 25% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
