&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloudflare is looking for a Strategy Manager to join the Developer GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Incubation team. This person will help plan and execute high-priority GTM programs across Cloudflare, turning key market, events, and customer moments into coordinated engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Developer GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Incubation function exists to evolve the way the Developer GTM team works, designing systems, processes, and GTM motions that accelerate consumption at Cloudflare. A core part of that work is helping teams operate with shared context, clear priorities, strong execution, and consistent follow-through across varying cross-functional teams in GTM.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone with a strong background in strategy, business ops, or revenue ops. This is an ideal opportunity for someone who thrives in fast-paced environments, loves solving ambiguous problems, and can balance multiple priorities across cross-functional teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate priorities into plans:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Developer GTM leadership to turn strategic priorities into clear work streams, owners, milestones, decisions, and success measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner across high-priority GTM programs:&lt;/strong&gt; Own or co-own planning and execution for programs such as Cloudflare Connect, SKO, Build Week-style initiatives, innovation weeks, enablement programs, leadership off-sites, and cross-functional planning cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build cross-functional alignment: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as connective tissue across Developer GTM, Product, Marketing, Sales, Enablement, Growth, Community, technical teams, and other partners. Keep teams aligned on goals, sequencing, messaging, tradeoffs, and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Narrative Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate priorities into clear internal narratives, leader talking points, field enablement, team-wide updates, and practical guidance that helps teams understand what is changing and how to act on it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support broader Strategy &amp;amp; Incubation work:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead high-priority projects across Developer GTM, support team planning and process improvements, and incubate new motions until they are clear, measurable, and ready for durable ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Examples of projects this person may own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the Developer GTM strategy and execution plan for Cloudflare Connect or SKO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the planning rhythm, narrative, and follow-up model for a Build Week-style program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Enablement to turn a leadership priority into field-ready messaging, manager guidance, and follow-up actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a cross-functional operating plan for a priority GTM initiative spanning Product, Marketing, Sales, and technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a lightweight process for leadership planning, stakeholder updates, decision tracking, and retrospectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Desirable Skills, Knowledge, and Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience working in roles like GTM strategy, business operations, chief of staff, strategic programs, consulting, or a similar cross-functional role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving complex initiatives across Sales, Product, Marketing, Enablement, technical teams, and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment and the ability to simplify ambiguity into a practical plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to turn leadership direction into clear narratives, operating plans, and stakeholder updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong program management skills, including ownership of timelines, work streams, dependencies, risks, readouts, and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning or leading high-impact GTM programs such as SKOs, customer events, launches, enablement programs, leadership off-sites, or cross-functional planning cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership and strong bias for action. This person should be comfortable pushing work forward without perfect information and aligning teams without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen and comfort using data to define success metrics, track impact, and make tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about technical products, developer platforms, consumption-led GTM motions, and how Cloudflare brings new ideas to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-priority Developer GTM programs have clear goals, owners, narratives, timelines, and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developer GTM leadership has a trusted partner who can turn priorities into coordinated cross-functional execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Events, enablement, communications, and internal initiatives are connected to the broader GTM strategy instead of operating as disconnected projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional partners understand what Developer GTM is prioritizing, why it matters, and what they need to do next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambiguous priorities move into execution faster, with clearer ownership, cleaner stakeholder alignment, and better organizational learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
