&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1,0&quot;&gt;For Washington D.C. Metro and Washington (Kirkland) based hires: Estimated annual salary of $120,000 - $165,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1,0&quot;&gt;For Colorado based hires: Estimated annual salary of $98,000 - $135,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
