&lt;li&gt;Define the long-term vision and operating model for Executive Support at Datadog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive headcount planning, resource allocation, and org design as the company scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain policies, playbooks, and documentation that standardize high-quality support across all executive stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement process improvements that increase efficiency and reduce friction across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an escalation point for complex, high-stakes, or sensitive executive support needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain discretion and judgment around confidential information at the highest levels of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance, Legal, People, and leaders across the business to ensure EA operations align with company-wide policies and systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to global offices and company conferences, as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
