&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in executive or administrative support, with at least 4+ years in a people management role leading other managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build and scale an EA organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep fluency in executive-level support workflows: complex calendar management, travel logistics, budget oversight, and event execution&lt;/li&gt;
