&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a deeply technical product leader to lead the four teams responsible for Figma&#39;s Code area: Code Context, Design to Code, Code to Design, and Code Platform. You&#39;ll manage and grow a team of Product Managers while partnering closely with engineering, design, data, and research leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
