&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5266&quot; data-local-id=&quot;26b3ca91278f&quot;&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
