unities regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity/expression, veteran status&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;or any other characteristic protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
