&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing development practices across an engineering organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with doing first draft UI designs in code that use established mobile UI/UX patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
