&lt;li&gt;Full-stack experience with modern front-end frameworks (e.g., React/TypeScript) and back-end technologies (e.g., Ruby, Go, Node.js, PostgreSQL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, with experience working effectively across functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
