&lt;li&gt;Design and build large-scale distributed data systems that power analytics, AI/ML, and business intelligence across Figma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop batch and streaming solutions to ensure data is reliable, efficient, and scalable across the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and evolve core platforms like Snowflake, our ML Datalake, orchestration infrastructure, and real-time ingestion systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve data reliability, consistency, and compliance, ensuring high-quality data for engineering, research, and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
