&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with AI researchers, data scientists, product engineers, and business teams to understand data needs and build scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive technical decisions and best practices for data ingestion, orchestration, processing, and storage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and support engineers, fostering a culture of learning and technical excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
