&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with redesigns, information architecture, and content hierarchy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building in multi-product environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design tooling expertise or experience as a Designer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping mobile and desktop products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
