&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to overall strategy and decision-making about product direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help deliver clear storytelling around customer needs and business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with product management, engineering, and design peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, collaborate, and iterate on flows, prototypes, and high-fidelity visuals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and ship high-quality features and product improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a mentor and provide thoughtful feedback to your peers (and benefit from strong personal and professional mentorship opportunities yourself!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/h4&gt;
