&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Design to build and execute a long-term roadmap that delivers a world-class user experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional partners and engineering teams to creatively solve complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, manage, support, and develop a team of engineers, including staff level engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish trust within and across teams by creating accountability and a positive work environment in partnership with other organizational leaders&lt;/li&gt;
