&lt;li&gt;Ability to think strategically about engineering and product roadmaps, on both short and longer term time horizons&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates rigorous thinking and effective decision-making in cross-functional environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with billing, SaaS monetization and/or payments infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
