&lt;li&gt;Work with Voice of the Customer, Product, and Engineering teams to surface meaningful insights that drive product and journey improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and insights from Product Support Analytics to surface trends, improve product quality, and inform strategic decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support high-complexity Enterprise escalations, ensuring consistent, high-quality technical outcomes by partnership cross-functionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
