&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong analytical expertise, and extensive experience building integrated models from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience building relationships and communicating with stakeholders across all levels and functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Track record of building processes from scratch &amp;amp; methodically resolving potential road-blocks&lt;/li&gt;
