&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As an AV Production Specialist, you will be a critical part of supporting the technical aspects of Figma&#39;s internal events. As a member of the broader IT Team, the ideal candidate is an excellent communicator, customer service oriented, highly organized, and can adapt quickly when event schedules or technical needs change on short notice. This role will report directly to the AV Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
