&lt;p&gt;The Talent Acquisition team works at the center of GitLab&#39;s growth, partnering with hiring managers and business leaders to bring exceptional talent into the company. As part of Talent Acquisition, you&#39;ll help connect candidates to a company that is helping organizations improve developer productivity, operational efficiency, and security through GitLab&#39;s intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. This team values clear communication and a practical, data-informed approach to hiring. You&#39;ll join a globally distributed group that embraces collaboration, continuous learning, and the use of AI in daily workflows to improve efficiency, innovation, and impact. It&#39;s a team for people who care deeply about candidate experience, strong partnership, and helping GitLab co-create the future.&lt;/p&gt;
