&lt;li&gt;Act as the GitLab liaison for GitLab questions, issues, or escalations. Work with GitLab Support, Product Management (i.e., roadmaps), or other teams as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a book of assigned customers, with a focus on increasing adoption, ensuring retention and growth, and overall customer satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
