&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3122&quot; data-local-id=&quot;09a70c118dda&quot;&gt;Experienced in product development, solution architecture or engineering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3200&quot; data-local-id=&quot;12afe9da0db0&quot;&gt;You have a &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;BS&lt;/span&gt;/MS/PhD in a STEM field or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
