&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f39cc1341ad0&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2171&quot; data-local-id=&quot;46e2e0ee35e1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Strong systems thinker&lt;/strong&gt;: you connect cause and effect across the data platform — from intake through query — and hold the throughline as scope evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2325&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a3589a3f7960&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Cross-org synthesizer&lt;/strong&gt;: you read across staff engineers, consuming product teams, sales / FinOps, and finance, and turn diffuse signals into a defensible product position.&lt;/p&gt;
