&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2682&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0c6e6132c59e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Collaborative and opinionated&lt;/strong&gt;: you build trust quickly with engineers, PM peers, designers, and commercial partners; bring strong product opinions and adapt when new evidence emerges.&lt;/p&gt;
