&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2869&quot; data-local-id=&quot;826140d9e34f&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Comfortable operating with ambiguity and breadth&lt;/strong&gt;: you thrive in foundational platform work where the scope shapes itself over multiple quarters.&lt;/p&gt;
