&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;999&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ece67c645e17&quot;&gt;Own and drive the roadmap for Datadog’s AWS Serverless observability products, including Lambda, Fargate, and Step Functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1127&quot; data-local-id=&quot;16967e091c18&quot;&gt;Define how developers monitor, debug, and operate serverless systems across distributed environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1231&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d07401e1df83&quot;&gt;Partner with engineering and design to deliver end-to-end product capabilities from concept through launch and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1355&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e7bee333e3d0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with AWS product teams to align roadmaps and deliver joint solutions for shared customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1460&quot; data-local-id=&quot;44bfcc5d4c38&quot;&gt;Engage with customers to understand serverless adoption patterns and validate product direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1460&quot; data-local-id=&quot;44bfcc5d4c38&quot;&gt;Define and track success metrics such as adoption, usage, and impact on developer workflows&lt;/li&gt;
