&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;36&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1ce585acfcfa&quot;&gt;Datadog’s Search team helps users – both human and agents – find answers to their questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;131&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5576058a6309&quot;&gt;Search is a critical function in Datadog, and touches many product surfaces: the query editors in product homepages and dashboards, search bars for finding relevant assets, the global cmd+k navigation search, and the &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;MCP&lt;/span&gt; tools that our Bits AI agent uses to respond to natural language prompts. Search is a full-stack team: owning user-facing search components, backend search ranking systems, and machine learning models to produce recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;583&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2563a8eb8da8&quot;&gt;The Search team is relatively new, and still growing. We have recently built out agentic search tools, and we are looking for a leader to help us expand to ambitious orchestration systems that deliver accurate results, and proactive recommendations across both keyword and semantic search. Beyond this, you’ll have room to influence how Datadog thinks about Search as a strategic surface.&lt;/p&gt;
