&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0a955fd86b&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2266&quot; data-local-id=&quot;73f43effc78f&quot;&gt;Have 5+ years of B2B SaaS Product Management experience, with specific exposure to Network Performance Monitoring, Cloud Infrastructure, or IT Operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2424&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fbbbfd059b4d&quot;&gt;Possess a deep understanding of how network performance impacts user experience and application reliability&lt;/p&gt;
