&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the vision, strategy, and roadmap for Datadog&#39;s Agent Builder platform and ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the core platform capabilities that enable customers and partners to create, customize, deploy, and manage AI agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the extensibility model for agents, including integrations, tools, actions, context sources, APIs, SDKs, and developer workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how agents perform actions across Datadog products and third-party systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with AI, platform, infrastructure, and product teams across Datadog to establish common agent architecture patterns and platform standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of emerging agent frameworks, orchestration patterns, evaluation techniques, governance models, and operational best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be equally comfortable discussing LLM architectures, tool-calling systems, evaluation frameworks, and developer platforms with engineering teams as you are working directly with customers to understand their needs and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evangelize Datadog&#39;s vision for operational AI through customer engagements, conferences, blogs, industry events, and thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with world-class Product and Engineering teams to develop and communicate roadmaps that inspire our teams&#39; best work and deliver meaningful customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and empower Sales, Account Management, Marketing, and Solutions teams to drive adoption and customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a culture of learning and collaboration across the department and broader organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the bar in product management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An experienced Product Manager, ideally at a SaaS, infrastructure, platform, developer tools, or AI company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong technical background and can engage deeply on topics such as AI systems, APIs, platform architecture, developer tooling, distributed systems, and integration patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building platforms or ecosystems that enable other developers, teams, or products to create value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are excited by the opportunities and challenges of AI agents and have a strong point of view on how agentic systems will transform software development and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
