&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3236&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ccac445324e6&quot;&gt;You have excellent written and verbal communication skills, and are comfortable presenting and defending product decisions to cross functional stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
