&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2171&quot; data-local-id=&quot;22874344c5b9&quot;&gt;You have excellent verbal and written communication skills and the willingness to present and defend your ideas to technical stakeholders and executives alike&lt;/li&gt;
