&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;905&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f4505e2386c3&quot;&gt;Design, build, test, and implement AI-enabled workflows and tools, moving from proofs of concept to full production and adoption based on user feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
