&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2116&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1d172bbd5638&quot;&gt;At least 2 years of people management experience in a software engineering or similar setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2116&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1d172bbd5638&quot;&gt;Experience managing full stack development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2116&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1d172bbd5638&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills, including at delivering clear, actionable, and empathetic feedback&lt;/li&gt;
