&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow a team of Applied Scientists researching, prototyping, and industrializing AI/ML capabilities across the suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the technical vision and roadmap for the suite’s agentic and proactive AI/ML capabilities: event understanding, conversational analytics, insight reporting, and session-replay issue detection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay hands-on as a technical contributor and reviewer, helping the team move from research prototypes to production-grade capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how AI capabilities get built and delivered across the suite, partnering closely with product and engineering leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and onboard Applied Scientists as Datadog scales its investment in applied AI/ML&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the team’s progress and priorities to stakeholders across Product Analytics and Datadog’s broader AI efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An experienced technical leader with a background in applied AI/ML, ideally with hands-on research or applied science experience of your own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A people manager, whether established or early in your management journey, backed by strong technical credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in greenfield ambiguity: defining direction and structure where little exists yet, rather than executing against an established roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking ML/AI capabilities from research prototype to production, ideally in an analytics, NLP, or user-behavior domain&lt;/li&gt;
