&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of professional experience in FP&amp;amp;A, Data Analytics, Corporate Finance, Investment Banking, or other related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in finance, accounting, business, economics, or computer science&lt;/li&gt;
