&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Executive Assistant with at least 5+ years of experience to support high level executives. The ideal candidate will be proactive, highly organized and capable of managing complex schedules and administrative tasks. This role requires strong interpersonal skills, attention to detail and the ability to handle confidential information with discretion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
