&lt;li&gt;Solve complex problems in production distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across JavaScript, TypeScript, Rust, and C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help drive the continued evolution of the system.&lt;/li&gt;
