&lt;p&gt;Compensation may be adjusted depending on work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;San Francisco Estimated Base salary $131,000 - $180,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New York Estimated Base salary $126,000 - $173,000.&lt;/p&gt;
