&lt;li&gt;A minimum 5 years selling to the Canadian Federal Government in Ottawa, Ontario, with a strong emphasis on DND, Public Safety, clearance not required but a bonus if currently held&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven expertise navigating federal procurement mechanisms, PSPC contracting, and channel/VAR ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
