&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep expertise and fluency in Cloud Networking, Security and Edge Computing technologies&lt;/strong&gt;, with an exceptional ability to articulate features, benefits, and use cases across diverse customers within the &lt;strong&gt;Public, Energy, Telco and Financial&lt;/strong&gt; sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven ability to deeply understand complex customer IT architectures&lt;/strong&gt; and effectively map them to Cloudflare Reference Architectures for successful platform sales.&lt;/li&gt;
