&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Automation Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with leveraging Large Language Models (LLMs), prompt engineering, or modern automated workflows to optimize team productivity and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Aptitude:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with scripting or programming languages (e.g., JavaScript, Python) to better guide your team in edge computing and API integration discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
