&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloudflare seeks an experienced and dynamic First Line Sales Leader to drive and manage our US Enterprise Majors sales team covering the TOLA region. You will drive revenue across Fortune 500 accounts by combining modern value-selling with Cloudflare&#39;s AI-powered sales intelligence platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role demands deep platform expertise in security, networking, and edge computing, exceptional executive relationship-building skills, and a proven track record of closing multi-million dollar deals in high-growth environments. You will develop top-tier sales talent, coach complex deals, forecast with precision, and deliver predictable revenue while maintaining Cloudflare&#39;s builder culture.&lt;/p&gt;
