&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quota Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Own a $15–20M annual quota across a team of 6–8 Enterprise Account Executives focused on the largest, most strategic accounts in TOLA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast Precision:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain &amp;gt;90% forecast accuracy through disciplined weekly pipeline inspection using Salesforce, BoostUp, and Cloudflare&#39;s internal deal intelligence layers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consistent Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive consistent quota attainment—meet or exceed quarterly and annual targets with predictable, repeatable execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern GTM Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute modern GTM strategies for Fortune 500 companies navigating digital transformation, security modernization, and AI infrastructure needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
