&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3 to 5 years of experience in a customer-facing technical Pre-Sales role, such as Solutions Engineering, Customer Engineering, Sales Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Broad technical expertise spanning web application security, networking,&amp;nbsp; (routing, DNS, DDoS mitigation), SASE, cloud infrastructure, and enterprise architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
