&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s or master’s degree in computer science, Software Engineering, or equivalent experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
