&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A genuine interest in technology risk management, internal audit methodologies, or engineering compliance frameworks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
