&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This is a great opportunity to be a member of our high performing Sales team at a hyper-growth technology company. The Business Development Representative (BDR) will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
