&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple tasks/projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Bahasa Indonesia (verbal &amp;amp; written) to handle calls with customers across Indonesian market&lt;/li&gt;
