&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unmatched scale: Petabyte-scale data infrastructure, real-time pipelines at national scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open-source stack: Massive on-premise deployments (Hive, Spark, HDFS, Hadoop)&lt;/li&gt;
