&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a first-principles thinker who leads by example. You are passionate about translating complex data into actionable narratives and empowering your team to do the same.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you possess a natural curiosity and a drive to challenge the status quo to achieve better outcomes, you will thrive here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The gig&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an analytics leader, you won&#39;t just provide data—you will actively shape the strategy of our financial services business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor a team of analysts to drive business outcomes and growth, using high-fidelity data to inform sustainable decision-making across our product ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end analytics function—designing the right team structure, hiring top talent, building capabilities, and setting an uncompromisingly high bar for problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with business and product leaders, acting as a translator who turns complex business challenges into clear, solvable analytical problem statements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower your team to generate holistic, unbiased analyses that directly influence product roadmaps and business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a data-driven culture across various functions, effectively influencing stakeholders and driving cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a core strategic partner within your pod, going far beyond a traditional analytics counterpart to actively co-create the business roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of relevant analytics experience, including a minimum of 2 years in a Product Analytics role, plus proven experience directly managing and developing a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency handling large-scale data and running complex analyses using SQL. You possess the data modeling skills necessary to understand data flows and manage ETL processes at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural curiosity for how products work under the hood, paired with a strong penchant for business strategy and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical with the ability to consistently apply the right frameworks and methodologies to solve ambiguous problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of dashboarding principles with hands-on experience building actionable dashboards (prior experience with QlikSense is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in FinTech, payments, or financial services. Statistical modeling experience using Python or R is also a great-to-have.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PhonePe Full Time Employee Benefits (Not applicable for Intern or Contract Roles)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
