&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Risk strategies to manage Fraud and Credit Risk for Lending business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate alternate data sources to solidify the risk management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the best risk models&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
