&lt;p&gt;&lt;video controls=&quot;controls&quot; width=&quot;300&quot; height=&quot;150&quot;&gt;
&lt;source src=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mkZstuTlMFTM8sDh1x4NYm7WSLueqklb/view?resourcekey&quot;&gt;&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building a first of its kind AI content factory. As our AI Video Specialist, you are the master of the final render. You are a &lt;strong&gt;Video Creator&lt;/strong&gt; first. Your role is to bridge the gap between a scripted idea and a world class visual reality by orchestrating a complex, AI first production pipeline. You aren&#39;t just cutting footage: you are navigating the latent space to synthesize high fidelity, cinematic content that sets a new industry standard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Craft (The Hybrid Approach)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Neural Storytelling:&lt;/strong&gt; You own the edit. Beyond just running models, you are responsible for the narrative flow, the emotional beats, and the hook-driven pacing required for modern platforms. You use AI to generate the assets, but you use your creator&#39;s instinct to assemble the story and ensure the human element remains front and center.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Node-Based Logic:&lt;/strong&gt; You will spend the majority of your time in &lt;strong&gt;ComfyUI&lt;/strong&gt;, building custom, repeatable pipelines. You design workflows and style transfers that allow us to scale our production without losing creative control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Model Synthesis:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t rely on a single tool. You know how to take a base generation from an open source model like &lt;strong&gt;LTX&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Flux&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;Wan (Qwen)&lt;/strong&gt; and refine it using the high fidelity outputs of proprietary engines like &lt;strong&gt;Higgsfield&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master Temporal Consistency:&lt;/strong&gt; You design workflows that ensure stable, flicker free motion, maintaining character and environmental integrity across every frame of a production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cinematic Finishing:&lt;/strong&gt; You provide the final human touch. This includes advanced color science, sound design, and audio-visual synchronization to ensure the final output feels like a high-budget production, not a generic AI clip.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The AI Technical Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local and Open Source:&lt;/strong&gt; ComfyUI, Flux.1, LTX-2.3 Video, Wan 2.7 (Qwen) models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud and Proprietary:&lt;/strong&gt; Higgsfield Cinema Studio 3.5, Kling O3, SeeDance 2.0.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Control and Precision:&lt;/strong&gt; ControlNets, IP-Adapters, and specialized temporal upscaling nodes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enhancement:&lt;/strong&gt; Neural upscalers like Topaz and AI-driven audio cleanup tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be a great fit if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are a Filmmaker at heart.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand the visual grammar of cinema: pacing, lighting, and composition. You know how to steer AI models to achieve those professional standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You think in data-flows.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand the technical why behind a result, from sampler choice to CFG scales, and you can debug a complex node-based error in minutes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are a Researcher-Creator.&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable navigating GitHub, managing Python environments, and staying ahead of the latest paper to code releases in the open source world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are obsessed with Automation.&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t want to fix a single shot: you want to build a workflow that fixes the next thousand shots automatically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have a High Ownership Mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; You are the final wall of defense for the soul of the video. You ensure that the technology always serves the story, never the other way around.&lt;/li&gt;
