&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;Contribute to the evolution of our data platform architecture, improving scalability, reliability, observability, and data correctness across the stack.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
