&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with Go, Python or similar systems programming languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 6+ years of relevant engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience delivering production AI-powered products and customer-facing experiences using LLM technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You approach engineering through a strong product mindset and can connect technical decisions to customer outcomes and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
