&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a future opportunity that may not be immediately available, but we&#39;re proactively building our pipeline of exceptional talent. At GitLab, we believe in connecting with outstanding professionals before we have an urgent need, allowing us to move quickly when the right moment arises. If you are excited about co-creating the future as we&#39;re building the most comprehensive AI-powered DevSecOps platform, we want to hear from you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
