&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experimentation &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver customer-facing UI experiences and A/B experiments aimed at accelerating user acquisition, engagement, and retention through data-informed hypotheses.&lt;/li&gt;
