&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Languages &amp;amp; Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in TypeScript/JavaScript for building reusable SDKs and UI components, alongside strong knowledge of HTML, CSS, and modern JavaScript ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Serverless Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience building with high-scale serverless systems (e.g., Cloudflare Workers, AWS Lambda, Azure Functions).&lt;/li&gt;
