&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;System Design &amp;amp; APIs:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong foundation in system design—balancing engineering excellence with visual aesthetics—and experience working with or designing RESTful APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Development Workflows:&lt;/strong&gt; Background in building tools/frameworks to boost developer productivity, experience using modern AI/LLM augmented workflows, and a desire to thrive in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
