&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cloudflare, we are on a mission to help build a better Internet. Today the company runs one of the world’s largest networks that powers millions of websites and other Internet properties for customers ranging from individual bloggers to SMBs to Fortune 500 companies. Cloudflare protects and accelerates any Internet application online without adding hardware, installing software, or changing a line of code. Internet properties powered by Cloudflare all have web traffic routed through its intelligent global network, which gets smarter with every request. As a result, they see significant improvement in performance and a decrease in spam and other attacks. Cloudflare was named to Entrepreneur Magazine’s Top Company Cultures list and ranked among the World’s Most Innovative Companies by Fast Company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cloudflare, we’re not looking for people who wait for a polished roadmap; we’re looking for the builders who see the cracks in the Internet that everyone else has simply learned to live with. We value candidates who have the instinct to spot a &quot;normalized&quot; problem and the AI-native curiosity to create a solution using the latest tools. Our culture is built on iteration, leveraging AI to ship faster today to make it better tomorrow, while ensuring that every improvement, no matter how small, is shared across the team to lift everyone up. If you’re the type of person who values curiosity over bureaucracy, and that AI is a partner in solving tough problems to keep the Internet moving forward, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Available Locations - London&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Job Title&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gWqWw rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;Senior Solutions Architect&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gWqWw rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gWqWw rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;3&quot;&gt;As a Solution Architect for Cloudflare AI / Developer Platform and a member of the sales team, you will help customers understand the value proposition of the Cloudflare Developer Platform and demonstrate how to effectively build applications with Cloudflare products. Utilizing both technical and business skills, you will advise customers and sales teams, support strategic opportunities, architect innovative solutions, and develop proofs of concept and demonstrations. Serving as a trusted technical advisor, you will guide and enable clients, partners, and internal teams on product capabilities, positioning, and competitive intelligence while maintaining a tight feedback loop with product, product marketing, and pre-sales teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Role Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;gdAMzb&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Partner with the sales organization to drive revenue, new customers, and pipeline for AI and Developer Platform solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Lead technical discovery with customers and jointly architect best practice solutions to meet customer needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams including product management, sales, and marketing to drive platform adoption and revenue.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Present to strategic customers as an expert on Cloudflare Developer Platform solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Align Director and C-Level perceived business and technical value with Cloudflare developer solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Provide succinct feedback to cross-functional teams to deliver relevant developer content, use cases, customer stories, and data-driven value propositions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;11&quot;&gt;Role Requirements (Must-Have Skills)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;gdAMzb&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;12&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience selling or supporting technical sales in the cloud computing industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;13&quot;&gt;Deep technical expertise across cloud infrastructure and AI/ML, with experience building production systems combining both as a solutions engineer, entrepreneur, or solution architect.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;14&quot;&gt;In-depth knowledge of at least one major public cloud provider (e.g., AWS, GCP, Azure).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;15&quot;&gt;Practical experience designing, building, and deploying production web applications, with the ability to translate non-technical descriptions into high-level conceptual architectures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;16&quot;&gt;Full-stack software development experience using modern JavaScript frameworks, a variety of databases, Serverless tooling, and modern coding assistants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;17&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of developer workflows, including branching, versioning, CI/CD practices, and system integrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;18&quot;&gt;Knowledge of key market players and competitors in cloud computing, AI, and storage spaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;19&quot;&gt;Willingness and ability to travel up to 30%.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;20&quot;&gt;Nice-to-Have Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
