&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;23&quot;&gt;Experience providing structured customer feedback to influence product direction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rnc2Gd&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;24&quot;&gt;Active tracking of industry trends and advancements in cloud computing to inform product strategy and roadmap.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
