&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve developed reports, and you&#39;ve handled people who weren&#39;t performing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to work in an engineering-forward company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
