&lt;li&gt;Experienced with software supply chain security, build systems, provenance, artifact repositories, or CI/CD platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with proxying, protocol-aware systems, request interception, or high-performance policy engines&lt;/li&gt;
