&lt;p&gt;We are hiring for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Talent Acquisition Business Partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to join our Americas (AMER) team. In this role, you will act as a true talent advisor and go-to-market specialist, driving the expansion of hiring across the region. You will operate autonomously, utilizing your deep market expertise, AI-driven strategies, and extensive network to hire top-tier talent for Cloudflare.&lt;/p&gt;
