&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Utilization &amp;amp; Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Leverage foundational data layers and recruitment analytics to inform talent strategies, actively analyzing metrics such as time-to-hire and source efficiency to drive optimal operational decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
