&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9dd29e6a0f37&quot;&gt;Business Systems drives efficiency across Datadog through business process analysis, systems automation and integrations, AI agent and &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;MCP&lt;/span&gt; development, and vendor/software review. The team is increasingly embedded in cross-functional initiatives across People, Finance, &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;GTM&lt;/span&gt;, Legal, Recruiting, and Technical Solutions — translating ambiguous business problems into scoped, buildable solutions and owning delivery end-to-end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;427&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1305d1cf0d3e&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;429&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e3478c47f0c9&quot;&gt;This is not a generalist &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;BSA&lt;/span&gt; role. Each Senior BSA will own a cluster of business functions end-to-end, acting as an internal product manager for their domain rather than processing inbound requests reactively. There are two openings, each covering a different domain:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;699&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c362df054c5e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;People, Recruiting, Legal &lt;/strong&gt;or &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Finance, GTM, Procurement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;755&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3c6a78e82c63&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;757&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5a96a4901970&quot;&gt;As the role evolves alongside AI, Senior BSAs leverage agentic tools for data aggregation and context gathering while remaining the critical human-in-the-loop layer — owning business context and product outlook, validating use cases, managing stakeholder relationships, and making the judgment calls agents can&#39;t.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1072&quot; data-local-id=&quot;002682ee2f1f&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1074&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dd48febb50f8&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships that it builds, the creativity it brings to the table, and the collaboration of being together. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our employees can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;59bb54fe4262&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1349&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You’ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1369&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5a00c126f4f1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Discovery and scoping:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate ambiguous asks from business stakeholders into well-defined requirements that Business Systems Engineers can build against. Many stakeholders don&#39;t know what they want or the cross-functional impact of what they&#39;re asking for — you surface both before engineering begins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1677&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4e0327b25cb8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Cross-functional visibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify dependencies, downstream impacts, and integration considerations that requesting teams miss.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1811&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a790c65497f&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Proactive opportunity identification:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop deep domain knowledge to identify automation and AI opportunities before they become inbound requests, shifting the team from reactive intake to strategic partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2028&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bebe60858817&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Stakeholder relationship ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary point of contact for your domain, reducing ad hoc consultations that currently land on the team lead and senior ICs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2205&quot; data-local-id=&quot;41133b415467&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Systems and governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Review system configuration, data integrity, and vendor fit within your domain and make recommendations to stakeholders and BSEs; maintain clear documentation (process diagrams, system flows, user guides); ensure compliance with security and privacy standards (e.g., &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;GDPR&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;SOX&lt;/span&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2511&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5262b4c6b4d6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2527&quot; data-local-id=&quot;10abbc933237&quot;&gt;Prior experience as a Business Systems Analyst or in a similar role, ideally within a high-tech or SaaS environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2646&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ab08787d6a54&quot;&gt;Experience owning a business domain end-to-end; comfortable operating like an internal product manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2752&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bac0445cec5f&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to explain technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders and manage relationships with senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2931&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9e0745211ff7&quot;&gt;Comfortable using AI/agentic tools for data aggregation and context-gathering, while knowing where human judgment is still required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3066&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a4262ccbfc51&quot;&gt;Experience in managing projects, particularly those involving multiple stakeholders and complex integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3178&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3d9d7547ebd2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with security, privacy, and compliance standards (e.g., SOX, GDPR, SOC, ISO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3272&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b6a5869746d3&quot;&gt;4+ years as a business system administrator (e.g., NetSuite, Salesforce, Workday, Zendesk) or a business systems analyst leading complex, cross-functional projects or a similar role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3457&quot; data-local-id=&quot;727295298682&quot;&gt;4+ years managing multiple projects simultaneously and formulating business design documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3553&quot; data-local-id=&quot;baf4e6884852&quot;&gt;You are comfortable with deciphering technical documentation (e.g., API documentation) and translating business to technical requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3694&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ad94d53977a4&quot;&gt;By domain:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3708&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f5f62c754153&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;People, Recruiting, Legal domain:&lt;/strong&gt; exposure to &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;HRIS&lt;/span&gt;/ATS/contract lifecycle systems (e.g., Workday, Greenhouse) and the cross-functional dependencies between them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3872&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b01bd186f9c3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Finance, GTM, Procurement, Technical Solutions domain:&lt;/strong&gt; exposure to financial systems, deal desk, or procurement/vendor management tooling (e.g., NetSuite, Salesforce, Zendesk, Zip) and downstream data integrity implications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
