&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4363&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cec38568ac63&quot;&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4435&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0fd9d2ba26e9&quot;&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4512&quot; data-local-id=&quot;afa54976aeab&quot;&gt;Intradepartmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&lt;/li&gt;
