&lt;p class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the security architecture and implementation of Bits Code from early design through production operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineering, product, infrastructure, and security teams to identify risks and shape the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build threat models for new and existing agent risks such as prompt injection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the team ship secure software fast by writing and maintaining core libraries, and guiding processes and culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with our sandbox teams on how Bits Code executes untrusted workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be on call. Datadog culture is that you build it, you run it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a BS/MS/PhD in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related scientific field, or at least 5+ years of professional experience, with a background in product security,&amp;nbsp;application security, or security architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience securing systems that operate across complex trust boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building and operating full stack systems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are familiar with security risks in agentic systems and have experience designing against them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You make pragmatic security trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
