&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you&#39;re passionate about technology and want to &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
