&lt;li&gt;Partner with the team to identify and build AI-powered automations that improve deal desk efficiency and scale our operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 2years of overall experience including related processes such as sales operations, finance, sales strategy or sales enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of revenue recognition principles&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multi-task&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in fast paced, high pressure environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong quantitative skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong MS Word, Excel and PowerPoint skills&lt;/li&gt;
