&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of Pigment is a plus, but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in or understanding of a consumption-based software business model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in use of AI tools (e.g. ChatGPT, Claude)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
