&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1122&quot; data-local-id=&quot;197d84e11e5c&quot;&gt;Run and grow multiple Code Security products to meet revenue and business targets with the goal of building a multi-hundred million dollar annual business.&lt;/p&gt;
