&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1281&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5acde711d45a&quot;&gt;Lead and own product strategy and roadmap for accountable security products, fully aligned to revenue and business goals and with compelling differentiation and customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
