&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1623&quot; data-local-id=&quot;daa5121b82db&quot;&gt;Analyze and develop pricing and packaging strategies to maximize revenue through attaching deep understanding of market dynamics and other strategic leverage points.&lt;/p&gt;
