&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1792&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f0b4052aaaa1&quot;&gt;Drive &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;GTM&lt;/span&gt; strategy with GTM partner teams to achieve revenue and business goals&lt;/p&gt;
